  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.1",
      "verse_number": 1,
      "en": "Seek not to spread My gospels, and entice followers unto this, or that, saith Jehovih.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.2",
      "verse_number": 2,
      "en": "Neither go about preaching, saying: Thus saith Jehovih!",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.3",
      "verse_number": 3,
      "en": "Let all men hear Me in their own way.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.4",
      "verse_number": 4,
      "en": "No man shall follow another.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.5",
      "verse_number": 5,
      "en": "I will have no sect.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.6",
      "verse_number": 6,
      "en": "I will have no creed.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.7",
      "verse_number": 7,
      "en": "I am not exclusive; but I am with all My living creatures.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.8",
      "verse_number": 8,
      "en": "To those who choose Me, practicing their all highest light, I am a shield and fortification against all darkness, and against all evil and contention.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.9",
      "verse_number": 9,
      "en": "Thou shalt not establish Me by man's laws, nor by the government of man, saith Jehovih.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.10",
      "verse_number": 10,
      "en": "Nor establish by man's laws or government any book or revelation, saying: Behold, this is Jehovih's book.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.11",
      "verse_number": 11,
      "en": "To keep man from interfering with man, this hath been great labor.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.12",
      "verse_number": 12,
      "en": "To teach man to comprehend liberty, especially as to thought and as to knowledge, this hath been a great labor.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.13",
      "verse_number": 13,
      "en": "For he falleth easily under the inspiration of his surroundings, and falleth under the teachings and persuasions of his brother.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.14",
      "verse_number": 14,
      "en": "Because he cometh from My hand into the world in innocence, a helpless infant.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.15",
      "verse_number": 15,
      "en": "And his elder brothers take advantage of his innocence, and teach him their own knowledge, instead of directing him to Me.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.16",
      "verse_number": 16,
      "en": "And his elder brothers were in darkness themselves, and their elder brothers before them.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.17",
      "verse_number": 17,
      "en": "I said unto man: Be free! Learn to know liberty! Think for thyself! Study thy Creator in all things, and in thyself in particular!",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.18",
      "verse_number": 18,
      "en": "Turn thou away from thy elder brothers; come thou to the All Highest Fountain.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.19",
      "verse_number": 19,
      "en": "Be not confounded with abstruse reasonings; cut all things short, Godlike; learn thou of the Creator and His creations, there is nothing more.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.11.20",
      "verse_number": 20,
      "en": "Thou art one of the seeds of Jehovih, and wert planted by His Hand. Be thou free from all the world.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    }
  ],
  "preamble_source": null
}
